  "totalBlocks": 50,
  "translatedBlocks": 48,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "466b1b04d1e6e138",
      "translationZh": "这张表旨在帮助任何想要以有限预算搭建数据中心家庭实验室的人。我复制了大部分注重性价比、定位中端且速度表现不错的 GPU 结果，并将其输入 AI 或 SI，以下是得到的推荐结果。数据取自 Llama.cpp 讨论帖：Performance of llama.cpp with Vulkan #10879。该基准测试列出了 76 种不同的 GPU 型号。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97608f53cf0ae91b",
      "translationZh": "“测试‘Llama 2 7B model’，并使用 Q4_0，因为它计算简单，而且足够小，能够装入一块 4GB GPU。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2d1f81610ecf7c3a",
      "translationZh": "根据所提供的具体 llama-bench 基线数据，通过 Vulkan 后端运行本地 LLM 推理，会使性价比排序发生巨大变化。现代中端消费级显卡在解码（tg128）时受到较窄总线位宽（128-bit 或 192-bit）的严重限制，而企业级组件和采用超宽总线的老款旗舰卡则在性能与成本的比值上占据优势。通过将当前 2026 年二手市场价格（汇总 eBay 等二手平台及专业技术硬件社区的活跃趋势）与你的基线指标进行对比分析，得出了以下性能与成本比值排名。成本与性能效率公式综合权衡了购入价格、预填充速度（pp512）、解码吞吐量（tg128）以及可用显存总量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "807331eb2e3f31a5",
      "translationZh": "GPU 性能与成本比值前 20 名排名（二手市场）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "445412bdacfcaa3c",
      "translationZh": "排名 GPU 型号 预估二手价格 pp512（t/s） tg128（t/s） 显存容量 性能与成本比值 架构概况",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69f4abc48554e4d3",
      "translationZh": "绝对性价比之王：采用 320-bit 总线的精简版矿卡。在解码过程中，每花费一美元可获得约 1.3 tokens/sec 的速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c855edf72b46792a",
      "translationZh": "tg128 效率之王：完整的 1,024 GB/s HBM2 带宽。二手市场上每个 token 成本最优的解码引擎。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c1b73fd7a719a062",
      "translationZh": "采用与 MI50 相同的顶级 HBM2 显存基底，但配备了消费级显示输出接口。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c3ecb45c67071ef3",
      "translationZh": "老牌消费级猛将。凭借宽达352-bit的总线，它的解码性能经常超过低于300的现代架构。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "280034fea2116c9c",
      "translationZh": "经济型HBM2替代选择。较慢的核心处理速度限制了其预填充性能，但解码性能数值高得惊人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d99f89ac5fd53489",
      "translationZh": "均衡性出众。简洁的驱动架构带来了极高的解码速度，相较于现代硬件的各个档次尤为突出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb038b434a168836",
      "translationZh": "现代硬件中性价比突出的选择。RDNA3架构在计算任务上的扩展表现出色，内存吞吐量也十分优秀。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b63545a84de7264e",
      "translationZh": "消费级配置的入门标杆。以非常亲民的价格档位，为小型模型提供充足的显存容量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1dba8fce3f55e5d2",
      "translationZh": "企业级综合之选：Volta核心结构提供了极其可靠且迅猛的生成与预填充基准性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "153a4f5bf5553da9",
      "translationZh": "高效的Turing旗舰布局。凭借强悍的352-bit总线框架，速度超过了更新的同类产品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c14ab33f047be50b",
      "translationZh": "简洁、高度具有竞争力的 RDNA3 计算引擎，展现出出色的开箱即用 Vulkan 性能指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "33c4bea5e11e9d1a",
      "translationZh": "高达 20GB 的框架缓冲区容量。性能扩展表现出色，不过价格也更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "859a3df7a4220bd0",
      "translationZh": "获得 24GB 分配容量的最廉价入门选择。遗憾的是，FP16 计算速度欠佳，导致上下文加载依然缓慢。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97e50cc51441885e",
      "translationZh": "预填充速度上限极高。高性能核心弥补了标准 192-bit 总线结构的不足。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7ac2fd1234353478",
      "translationZh": "每美元所能获得的原始带宽惊人，但受到固定 8GB 显存上限的严格限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "883d9176888e2523",
      "translationZh": "英伟达 RTX 4070 Ti Super",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8186ce8e6110666e",
      "translationZh": "原始吞吐量基准测试表现出众，但前期投入成本也迈入了更高档位。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c99bb8497442da46",
      "translationZh": "Blackwell 中端配置。处理能力上限非常强劲，不过也带有当前市场的价格溢价。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6761ca1cb74bbe30",
      "translationZh": "极其低廉的入门门槛。以尽可能低的成本提供文本处理能力。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "077c3ea3f69e0d30",
      "translationZh": "低调的预算型节点。适用于要求基础组件价格低廉的多卡分布式矩阵。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a31b464ff38ac29",
      "translationZh": "下一代 RDNA4 架构架构布局。性能密度高，但硬件性能随成本增长的扩展性较低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f70038e781cea5c9",
      "translationZh": "Vulkan 结果中的关键策略启示",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64066c6fa1790f3c",
      "translationZh": "Token 生成（tg128）成本最低：AMD Instinct MI50 和 P102-100 完全扭曲了这条曲线。MI50 仅需约 120 的成本，就能在 Llama-7B 架构上提供超过 100 t/s 的速度；消费级桌面档次的产品需要两倍预算才能达到这一指标。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "053ca53f2702447f",
      "translationZh": "提示词处理（pp512）成本最低：得益于硬件张量能力，现代架构在预填充指标上占据主导地位。如果提示词处理延迟是你的关键瓶颈，可以考虑 RTX 4070 Super 或 RTX 5060 Ti，它们在输入处理速度上的表现远超自身档次。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "88098c20f5839121",
      "translationZh": "综合平衡最佳：GTX 1080 Ti 和 AMD Radeon RX 6800 达到了标准桌面节点的绝对“甜点区”。它们无需像无显示输出的数据中心设备（例如 Tesla 系列）那样进行严格的散热改装或专门的软件处理，同时能最大限度地提高每美元所能获得的带宽。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d15d6e3ed7e7fe05",
      "translationZh": "图表和总结由 Gemini 和我本人提供。我目前拥有 RX 7900 GRE、MI50、P102-100、GTX-1080Ti、GTX 1070、RX 480/580。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2db1b22614d919dc",
      "translationZh": "以下列出了排名前 20 的 GPU 在各项指标上的每 token/秒（\\( t/s\\)）成本明细。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "535ec68b2838c87c",
      "translationZh": "成本值（/t/s）越低，意味着每花一美元就能获得更多性能。综合吞吐量代表预填充和生成两者的均衡算术基准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "821a97a22cd34094",
      "translationZh": "GPU 型号 预估二手价格 pp512 每 t/s 成本 tg128 每 t/s 成本 综合每 t/s 成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "24d062fe99b02ed4",
      "translationZh": "以下根据所提供的基准测试数据集及当前二手市场价值趋势，对性能成本比最差的 10 款 GPU 进行排名。这些数值代表最高的每 token/秒成本（/t/s）。数值越高，意味着每获得一个单位的推理速度，就要支付多得多的费用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3a94a5326471c93",
      "translationZh": "排名 GPU 型号 预估二手价格 pp512 每 t/s 成本 tg128 每 t/s 成本 综合每 t/s 成本 主要瓶颈特征",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c83a1e51ca69df7e",
      "translationZh": "整体性价比最差：过时的 Maxwell 架构导致预填充和生成阶段的处理吞吐量都极低。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97dfd1a9c3212435",
      "translationZh": "收藏级溢价：尽管配备 HBM2 内存，但高昂的前期市场溢价使其性能价格比很差。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a892285979dd4ed",
      "translationZh": "预填充扩展能力极低，相比便宜得多的 MI50 框架，其部署实用性受到限制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4524a4ad8b68dc4f",
      "translationZh": "极端的解码瓶颈：极窄的 128-bit 总线使解码循环中每 token/sec 的数值达到 4.90，效率极其低下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2451fdb49246d1f0",
      "translationZh": "受限于入门级带宽配置，无法转化为有意义的计算价值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1daa38879dd18b29",
      "translationZh": "虽然因廉价的 24GB 容量而受到欢迎，但缺少原生 FP16 计算硬件，使其相对速度性价比大幅下滑。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8e89c19124d3aef6",
      "translationZh": "与价格低于 150 的现代二手同类产品相比，较老的 RDNA1 计算层使性能显著下降。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1536bd93373a6711",
      "translationZh": "在二手市场上溢价很高，却难以高效提升文本生成速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b474d2a9ca85a231",
      "translationZh": "相对于其市场价格区间，原始计算密度偏低，使其受到严重挤压。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a2bf3d5bd0135366",
      "translationZh": "Pascal 这一代的最底端。已被 P102-100 优越得多的成本性能曲线完全取代。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f493772070cfb2c",
      "translationZh": "Tesla P40 出现在了两张图表中。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26c21ca02cee1e5d",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/tabletuser_blogspot 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
